<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GOOD FOOD · GOOD DAYS</view><view class="row between"><view class="pill">{{space}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">处理中…</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning error">{{error}}</view><view class="title">一周，好好安排</view><view class="subtitle">把“想吃”放进具体的一天。</view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="changeDate"><view class="picker">{{date}} · 点击选择日期</view></picker><scroll-view scroll-x><view class="date-row"><view wx:for="{{dates}}" wx:key="date" class="date {{item.date===date?'selected':''}}" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="selectDate">{{item.label}}</view></view></scroll-view><view class="card"><view class="row"><picker range="{{meals}}" bindchange="mealChange"><view class="picker">{{meal}}</view></picker><input class="small" type="number" value="{{servings}}" data-field="servings" bindinput="field"/><text class="muted">人</text></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="addPlan">＋ 从菜谱选择</button><button id="action-shopping" bindtap="shopping">准备采购</button></view><view class="note">快捷选择展示前 6 道菜；也可从任意菜谱详情安排日期。</view></view><view wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row between"><view bindtap="openRecipe" data-id="{{item.recipeId}}"><view class="pill">{{item.meal}} · {{item.servings}} 人</view><view class="heading">{{item.title}}</view></view><button class="ghost" bindtap="removePlan" data-id="{{item.id}}">移除</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{!plans.length}}" class="empty">今天还没有安排，留一点期待。</view></view>